WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.022 --> 00:00:01.576
- There's like those
people that you're like,

00:00:01.576 --> 00:00:03.351
"Oh, they have an amazing Instagram"

00:00:03.351 --> 00:00:06.312
because it's just like a
lot of peoples' dream lives.

00:00:06.312 --> 00:00:07.145
- Gigi, gorgeous.

00:00:07.145 --> 00:00:07.978
- The Kardashians.

00:00:07.978 --> 00:00:08.811
- Kylie Jenner.

00:00:08.811 --> 00:00:09.644
- I love Kylie.

00:00:09.644 --> 00:00:11.885
- When the Kardashians post a
photo on their private jets,

00:00:11.885 --> 00:00:14.136
I feel like I should be on there.

00:00:14.136 --> 00:00:16.788
- I mean, what isn't
inspirational about a private jet?

00:00:16.788 --> 00:00:17.746
- Yeah.

00:00:17.746 --> 00:00:21.019
(upbeat music)

00:00:21.019 --> 00:00:23.028
- The whole lifestyle
associated with private jets

00:00:23.028 --> 00:00:25.419
is very exclusive and unattainable,

00:00:25.419 --> 00:00:27.253
so BuzzFeed reached out to JetSuite

00:00:27.253 --> 00:00:30.753
and we coordinated this whole shoot today.

00:00:44.611 --> 00:00:47.030
- I really like the idea
of tricking my friends.

00:00:47.030 --> 00:00:48.213
- Oh, I'm definitely going to be

00:00:48.213 --> 00:00:49.485
pretending like this is regular.

00:00:49.485 --> 00:00:51.784
- I went shopping this morning, so...

00:00:51.784 --> 00:00:54.756
I bought the jacket and I
bought the dress this morning.

00:00:54.756 --> 00:00:56.464
I really wanted to kind of embody

00:00:56.464 --> 00:00:58.117
what I thought a jetsetter would look like

00:00:58.117 --> 00:00:59.544
and I feel like I did that.

00:00:59.544 --> 00:01:00.952
- Oh my gosh!

00:01:00.952 --> 00:01:02.668
- I'm obsessed.

00:01:02.668 --> 00:01:04.524
- It's more than just
like "This picture's cute.

00:01:04.524 --> 00:01:05.357
We should post it."

00:01:05.357 --> 00:01:06.774
There's a science.

00:01:06.774 --> 00:01:10.076
- Of course, we had to bring
our Snapchat spectacles.

00:01:10.076 --> 00:01:12.426
Enjoying the private jet life.

00:01:12.426 --> 00:01:13.259
Ready?

00:01:14.473 --> 00:01:15.306
- Wee!

00:01:17.023 --> 00:01:18.690
- I love champagne.

00:01:19.684 --> 00:01:20.968
- Dude, I'm snapping everything.

00:01:20.968 --> 00:01:23.052
I Snapchat every second
of my f*cking life.

00:01:23.052 --> 00:01:24.377
- Good stuff!

00:01:24.377 --> 00:01:25.762
- I brought a lot of stuff.

00:01:25.762 --> 00:01:27.138
I didn't know what to bring so I

00:01:27.138 --> 00:01:28.554
just brought a little bit of everything.

00:01:28.554 --> 00:01:31.450
A raccoon, a horse, this
is like a Viking horn.

00:01:31.450 --> 00:01:33.700
(laughing)

00:01:37.232 --> 00:01:38.065
- This is Cid.

00:01:38.065 --> 00:01:39.393
Cid has an Instagram account.

00:01:39.393 --> 00:01:40.954
I am a middle school science teacher

00:01:40.954 --> 00:01:42.720
and I started an Instagram account

00:01:42.720 --> 00:01:47.001
primarily so my students
know that I am "with it".

00:01:47.001 --> 00:01:48.467
- [Off camera] Oh, that
is a dangerous choice.

00:01:48.467 --> 00:01:49.565
That was cool, though!

00:01:49.565 --> 00:01:50.613
- Oh my God, it looks so good.

00:01:50.613 --> 00:01:52.426
- You look so, like, expensive.

00:01:52.426 --> 00:01:53.259
- Oh thanks!

00:01:53.259 --> 00:01:54.450
- I look like I'm either with you

00:01:54.450 --> 00:01:58.200
because I want your
money or I owe you money.

00:02:01.127 --> 00:02:02.334
- Perception is reality.

00:02:02.334 --> 00:02:04.143
- On Instagram, you want
to stay true to yourself

00:02:04.143 --> 00:02:06.105
but you also wanna look super dope.

00:02:06.105 --> 00:02:09.646
- I'm not gonna post my
cousins' weddings on Instagram.

00:02:09.646 --> 00:02:11.272
Something like this, where I'm taking

00:02:11.272 --> 00:02:13.068
photos on a private jet, absolutely.

00:02:13.068 --> 00:02:14.400
- We're Instagram famous now.

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:18.131
- I was low-key channeling
my inner Kendall.

00:02:18.131 --> 00:02:21.127
I can't wait to see the
comments on Instagram.

00:02:21.127 --> 00:02:22.725
- Do you really experience something if

00:02:22.725 --> 00:02:24.930
it's not on Snapchat
or Instagram nowadays?

00:02:24.930 --> 00:02:26.392
- I think Instagram is really important

00:02:26.392 --> 00:02:28.129
because people can always
find you no matter what.

00:02:28.129 --> 00:02:30.313
- Social media is like
making a paper airplane

00:02:30.313 --> 00:02:32.723
out of your resume and
throwing it out the window.

00:02:32.723 --> 00:02:35.034
- As a recording artist,
we definitely have to look

00:02:35.034 --> 00:02:38.113
like we have more money
than we actually have.

00:02:38.113 --> 00:02:39.892
- Kind of a necessary evil, I guess.

00:02:39.892 --> 00:02:42.710
- Instagram is only a
highlight reel of your life.

00:02:42.710 --> 00:02:44.291
- I feel like people probably
wouldn't be surprised

00:02:44.291 --> 00:02:45.877
if you said that you owned this jet.

00:02:45.877 --> 00:02:48.177
- I've always kind of been
preparing for this lifestyle,

00:02:48.177 --> 00:02:49.987
and it's good to know I was right.

00:02:49.987 --> 00:02:51.037
- You do look like Kendall Jenner.

00:02:51.037 --> 00:02:51.870
- Thanks. That's sweet.

00:02:51.870 --> 00:02:52.996
- Watch out, Kendall Jenner.

00:02:52.996 --> 00:02:54.746
She's coming for you.

